# The notebook is committed with its executed outputs so the analysis is
# readable on GitHub without running anything. Those outputs are large, which
# made GitHub's language bar report the project as ~75% "Jupyter Notebook" and
# hid the Python and T-SQL that the project is actually built from. Marking the
# notebook as documentation keeps it rendered and browsable but excludes it from
# the language statistics.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation

# Generated figures are committed deliberately (see .gitignore) but are output,
# not source.
reports/figures/*.png linguist-generated

# Normalise line endings so the same file does not show as modified on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
